description:
Step 1 of onboarding. Returns a short code (valid 15 min). Show it to your human operator: a VERIFIED requester confirms it in the dashboard at https://workman.rent/zamovnik.html. Then call pairing_status with the code. There is no anonymous self-registration.
No verified requester yet? Try the SANDBOX first (sandbox_signup_start): full task flow with a bot, no verification.
Returns: { code, expires_in, poll_after, instruction }
